  "result": "Excellent! All 46 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Adds or updates a line on a draft invoice:\n- If the SKU already exists, increases its qty\n- If it's new, adds it with product info from the catalogue\n- Validates qty and SKU like `createInvoice` (returns `QTY_INVALID`, `UNKNOWN_SKU`)\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if the invoice isn't a draft\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Removes a line from a draft invoice:\n- Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns `NO_LINES` if it would remove the last line\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if the invoice isn't a draft\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n\nAdded two new error codes: `NOT_DRAFT`, `LINE_NOT_FOUND`. Tests cover all validation, mutation safety, and property preservation. \u2714",
